{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03555","headline":"清明日龙门游泛 · 李峤","name":"清明日龙门游泛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晴晓国门通，都门蔼将发。\n纷纷洛阳道，南望伊川阙。\n衍漾乘和风，清明送芬月。\n林窥二山动，水见千龛越。\n罗袂罥杨丝，香桡犯苔发。\n羣心行乐未，唯恐流芳歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}